Design goals:
- self-discovery: `crm commands`, `crm schema`, `crm <module> schema`
- safe planning: every live command supports `--dry-run`
- offline contract tests: every live command supports `--mock`
- machine output: always JSON envelope with count/data/error/meta
"""
